+    /**
+     * Story 11.5 — create the keyset pull indexes ({@code (cursor, CAST(id AS text))} per delta
+     * table) on an existing tenant schema. Each index runs under its own savepoint: one that
+     * cannot be built (lock timeout, legacy table missing a column) is logged and skipped
+     * without rolling back the rest of the sync; the next sync retries it ({@code IF NOT EXISTS}).
